{
 "description": "Use before writing or fixing Vega (not Vega-Lite) visualization specs for render_diagram (format vega): strict JSON, scales/marks wiring, inline data only, error meanings, worked examples, identifier rule.",
 "identifier": "Keep the identifier as a data field and map it through a scale: `\"data\":[{\"name\":\"t\",\"values\":[{\"id\":\"n0002\",\"label\":\"engine\",\"v\":3}]}]` with `{\"scale\":\"x\",\"field\":\"id\"}` for position and a `text` mark using `{\"field\":\"label\"}` for the display name. Never invent identifiers.",
 "examples": [
